      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. NUMBER SYSTEM – BASIC CONCEPT"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The chapter establishes foundational concepts of the Number System and various types of numbers.",
        "Crucial mathematical properties are emphasized for SSC competitive exams.",
        "Divisibility rules serve as a major high-frequency topic in quantitative aptitude.",
        "Covers comprehensive preparation through factors, multiples, solved examples, practice questions, and answer keys."
      ],
      "id": "alebz70"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zv0bvxa",
      "content": "Number System deals with classification and properties of numbers used in calculations.<br></br><br></br>In SSC examination, questions from Number System are:<br></br>• Basic<br></br>• Concept-based<br></br>• Usually one or two steps only"
    },
