    {
      "id": "r3qv6bf",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. FACTORS & MULTIPLES"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1q1xj8e",
      "content": "Factor: A number that divides another number exactly.<br></br>Multiple: The result obtained after multiplication.<br></br><br></br>Important Points:<br></br>• Smallest factor of any number is 1<br></br>• Largest factor of any number is the number itself"
    },
    {
      "id": "asczs0u",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. SOLVED EXAMPLES"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "857nowt",
      "content": "<strong>Example 1:</strong><br></br>Which of the following is a prime number?<br></br>A. 21   B. 29   C. 39   D. 51<br></br><br></br>Answer: 29<br></br><br></br><strong>Example 2:</strong><br></br>What is the unit digit of 7⁴?<br></br>7¹ = 7<br></br>7² = 49<br></br>7³ = 343<br></br>7⁴ = 2401<br></br><br></br>Answer: 1"
    },
    {
